    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20747" root="سمق" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُمَاقٌ</span></b>  <i>Pure; sheer; unmixed.</i> (S, O, K.) You
say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَذِبٌ سُمَاقٌ</span> <i>A sheer, unmixed, lie;</i> (S, O;)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبٌّ سُمَاقٌ</span> <i>pure, unmixed, love;</i> meaning
<i>such as have overtopped</i> (↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمَقَا</span></b> ) <i>every lie</i> and
<i>love.</i> (O.)

